.TH focusforge-cli-history-compact 1  "compact 0.1.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-history\-compact \- Rewrite the project to its live checkpoints only and report the bytes reclaimed
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli history compact\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rewrite the project to its live checkpoints only and report the bytes reclaimed
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the JSON report instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to compact
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.1
